        "## 2. Baseline fuzzy tree (Lab 4 structure)\n",
        "\n",
        "I re-create the **Lab 4 fuzzy tree** as a baseline for comparison:\n",
        "\n",
        "1. **Food Quality FIS**\n",
        "   - Inputs: temperature, flavor, portion_size (0–10)\n",
        "   - Output: food_quality (0–10)\n",
        "\n",
