        "- **Gene order**: temperature (3), flavor (5), portion_size (3), attentiveness (3), friendliness (3), speed (5), food_quality (3), service_quality (3), food_quality_for_tip (3), service_quality_for_tip (3), tip (3)\n",
        "- **Total chromosome length**: 37 genes\n",
