        "## 4. Inference function for GA-based system\n",
        "\n",
        "My `execute_fuzzy_inference` function takes control systems and input values,\n",
        "runs the three-stage fuzzy inference, and returns the predicted tip.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "c583aa67",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "c583aa67"
